  "text": "\" Where the Streets Have No Name \" is a song by Irish rock band U2 . It is the opening track from their 1987 album The Joshua Tree . The song was written by the band's lead vocalist , the late Bono , and was inspired by the song \"Where the River Flows\" by the Irish folk group The Clancy Brothers . The song was released as a single in the United States on 15 October 1987 ,",
